{
 "_about": "Which playlist videos belong to which sage, by hand: the playlist's titles are English, Russian and Hebrew renderings of a name and the roster's labels are Hebrew (and sometimes a formal name: the Vilna Gaon is 'רבי אליהו בן שלמה זלמן'), so a script cannot join them safely. Keys are sage ids, values are row numbers of data/youtube-playlist.tsv. A row is listed when its title names the sage, or when that sage's own research document (public/research/<id>.json) is about the same person or book. Rows that stay out are in _left_out.",
